    "description": "Vintage Writing Instrument Estate Lot\nCross 12KT Gold Filled Set and Garland Chrome Set\n2 Boxed Sets (4 total pieces), Vintage\nThis estate lot features two distinct vintage writing instrument sets, including a premium Cross 12KT gold-filled ballpoint pen and mechanical pencil set. Accompanied by a two-piece Garland set, these writing tools represent mid-to-late 20th-century professional style. The Cross set is a classic Model 6601, known for its slim profile and durable gold-filled finish, making it a staple of executive stationery.\nITEMS INCLUDED:\n1.\nCross Pen & Pencil Set (Model 6601)\n- 12KT Gold Filled construction, includes ballpoint pen and matching mechanical pencil in original black presentation box.\n2.\nGarland Pen Set\n- Two matching pens featuring white barrels and polished chrome-tone caps, housed in a white and gold-trimmed Garland presentation box.\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. The Cross pieces appear well-preserved; one instrument remains wrapped in original protective tissue. The Garland pens show clean barrels and bright chrome finishes with minimal surface wear. Presentation boxes are intact with minor shelf wear on exterior edges. Ink cartridges have not been tested for flow or remaining capacity.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
